    <string name="safety_title">Train safely</string>
    <string name="safety_body">Warm up first. Do each exercise only with clean form; if you can\'t, take the easier option or cut range, reps or sets. Leave a rep or two in reserve and never force shoulder range, like the German hang. Stop for sharp pain, numbness, dizziness or loss of control, and see a doctor if it lasts.</string>
    <string name="about_title">About Street Gymnastics</string>
    <string name="about_body">We made Street Gymnastics from our own training. No AI, no setup, nothing to choose: like a class, today\'s is ready for you. Move on when it feels easy, or repeat it until it does.</string>
